## iOS Skills

7 specialized skills are available for iOS/Apple development:

| Skill | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `swift-concurrency` | Async/await, actors, Sendable, Swift 6 migration |
| `swiftui-expert-skill` | SwiftUI best practices, state management, Liquid Glass |
| `swift-charts` | Data visualizations with Swift Charts |
| `mobile-ios-design` | iOS Human Interface Guidelines, SwiftUI patterns |
| `macos-design-guidelines` | macOS HIG, AppKit, window management |
| `ios-glass-ui-designer` | Glass material UI design (translucency, blur, depth) |
| `ios-tech-docs` | Technical documentation generation for iOS projects |

Use `/skill <name>` to invoke any skill. Skills are installed {{ if eq .SkillsScope "global" }}globally in `~/.claude/skills/`{{ else }}per-project in `.claude/skills/`{{ end }}.
